  "description": "San once found comfort in Hee-Min’s kindness. Years later, he confesses the love he has kept hidden, not to win Hee-Min over but to finally walk away with closure. To his surprise, Hee-Min accepts his feelings without hesitation. Struggling to trust something that feels too easy, San finds himself torn between doubt and longing. He yearns for a kind of love he has never learned how to receive. A tender and tangled love begins between a black-haired beast still learning how to be human, and the man who never turned him away.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
